{"unit_id":"Alain-Prot0s5__dsh-screenshot#card-zh","repo":"Alain-Prot0s5/dsh-screenshot","commit":"043a5f4bc6eb340944fe2835a71cc32cddc85a89","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-screenshot 是面向 DSH Desktop 的截图输入插件：它在对话输入框旁加入相机按钮，并提供可配置的全局热键。触发后调用 Windows 系统截图工具，检测剪贴板图像，再将截图粘贴到 DSH 输入框；设置页可调整热键、自动粘贴和后台切换行为。宿主插件负责随桌面应用启停监听器，客户端按钮通过本机服务触发截图。适合在 Windows 桌面上把屏幕内容快速作为对话输入；需要 DSH Desktop、Windows 10（1809+）或 Windows 11，以及 PowerShell 5.1。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:216-241","lib/index.js:70-117","dsh-screenshot.ps1:294-321"]}
{"unit_id":"Alain-Prot0s5__dsh-screenshot#card-en","repo":"Alain-Prot0s5/dsh-screenshot","commit":"043a5f4bc6eb340944fe2835a71cc32cddc85a89","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-screenshot adds a camera button and configurable hotkey to DSH Desktop. It opens the Windows snipping tool, waits for a clipboard image, and pastes it into the composer. Settings control hotkey and paste behavior; the host manages the listener lifecycle. Requires Windows 10/11 and DSH Desktop.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:216-241","lib/index.js:70-117","dsh-screenshot.ps1:294-321"]}
